{
    "word": "pestiferous",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b216491c-97ef-3bd6-9e93-5f1e64d3e735",
                "word": "pestiferous",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "7afd7311-dddb-41b6-9bda-1442b4386ad6",
                        "entry_id": "b216491c-97ef-3bd6-9e93-5f1e64d3e735",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more pestiferous"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "fee11cca-6e90-4770-8825-a2b5c523e978",
                        "entry_id": "b216491c-97ef-3bd6-9e93-5f1e64d3e735",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most pestiferous"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b7f19286-2fe6-3f02-9977-98724dd4d80a",
                        "entry_id": "b216491c-97ef-3bd6-9e93-5f1e64d3e735",
                        "glosses": [
                            "containing organisms that cause contagious diseases"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e22181d-ef98-4649-85e1-161054d0e563",
                                "sense_id": "b7f19286-2fe6-3f02-9977-98724dd4d80a",
                                "text": "because he hath vouchsafed to preserue our nation from such fountains, from serpents and venemous wormes, & from al other pestiferous & contagious creatures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "41c8499e-eaf3-40d7-a7e5-b181401923cf",
                                "sense_id": "b7f19286-2fe6-3f02-9977-98724dd4d80a",
                                "text": "In these solemn moments man discovers the germ of those vices, which like the Java tree shed a pestiferous vapour around--death is in the shade!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6827165f-d68a-47d9-8162-a2ac1b860ed2",
                                "sense_id": "b7f19286-2fe6-3f02-9977-98724dd4d80a",
                                "text": "and bears the body of our dear brother here departed to a hemmed-in churchyard, pestiferous and obscene, whence malignant diseases are communicated to the bodies of our dear brothers and sisters who have not departed..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5b26875-42ff-42b3-9839-47419265d9c1",
                                "sense_id": "b7f19286-2fe6-3f02-9977-98724dd4d80a",
                                "text": "Wherever there is a vacant space the authorities have allowed refugees to put up pestiferous shacks, which now flank in unbroken lines the country roads leading into Rangoon, the railway tracks, and the shores of the Royal Lake."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6bb0f5d-577d-33e6-8073-351cb8e26451",
                        "entry_id": "b216491c-97ef-3bd6-9e93-5f1e64d3e735",
                        "glosses": [
                            "annoying, vexatious"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "567ecdfa-3215-46d6-a42a-e4440ab622ff",
                                "sense_id": "b6bb0f5d-577d-33e6-8073-351cb8e26451",
                                "text": "No, prelate; such is thy audacious wickedness, / Thy lewd, pestiferous, and dissentious pranks, / As very infants prattle of thy pride."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b610c20-f26a-44d7-bb93-2b3cbaa436cd",
                                "sense_id": "b6bb0f5d-577d-33e6-8073-351cb8e26451",
                                "text": "and if any could have hanged his hindering and pestiferous council and set him free, he would have answered Joan's prayer and set her in the field."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b0a41e8-1433-44f3-8beb-d5c6792820fc",
                                "sense_id": "b6bb0f5d-577d-33e6-8073-351cb8e26451",
                                "text": "Lois rescues Clark from the pestiferous curly..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "55cc8b91-5359-41bb-b75c-8110b07f1fa9",
                        "source_entry_id": "b216491c-97ef-3bd6-9e93-5f1e64d3e735",
                        "source_sense_description": "containing organisms that cause contagious diseases",
                        "target_lang_word": "pestilentiel",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pestilentiel",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "869c3d3f-34e0-3d5b-bd7a-6b9a6366ec51",
                                        "entry_id": "4da65f8b-cd61-3242-8c6f-bec0665740d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a les caractères de la peste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e2a7180-7fec-41d2-9c7d-caea8154aa08",
                                                "sense_id": "869c3d3f-34e0-3d5b-bd7a-6b9a6366ec51",
                                                "text": "Des maladies pestilentielles désolaient de plus les Gaulois campés dans des bas-fonds, au milieu d'un cercle d'éminences et sur un terrain brûlant, que tant d'incendies avaient imprégné d'exhalaisons enflammées, et où le moimdre vent les offusquait de poussière et de cendre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3176a12-a0c0-3383-a6ff-80025af83ffd",
                                        "entry_id": "4da65f8b-cd61-3242-8c6f-bec0665740d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui donne la peste et, par extension, qui est infecté."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8e4265f-5c44-469a-97b2-e7061d3ab5fa",
                                                "sense_id": "c3176a12-a0c0-3383-a6ff-80025af83ffd",
                                                "text": "À Mogador, nouvelle relâche, […]. C’est là qu’ils embarquèrent la Mort Pourpre, et ils remirent à la voile en emportant les germes pestilentiels."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60bb2f26-4f39-3097-bf6f-8c7598f406fd",
                                        "entry_id": "4da65f8b-cd61-3242-8c6f-bec0665740d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui émet une odeur nauséabonde."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bd305e7-c744-44c4-b215-d6b184cd790c",
                                                "sense_id": "60bb2f26-4f39-3097-bf6f-8c7598f406fd",
                                                "text": "A peine ai-je pénétré dans la salle bondée où règne une odeur pestilentielle de pied, qu'un médecin m'interpelle et m'invite, de son index, à le suivre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6840b8ec-fd7b-4f82-ab3d-ab324a044f60",
                                                "sense_id": "60bb2f26-4f39-3097-bf6f-8c7598f406fd",
                                                "text": "La pestilentielle odeur de friture à l’huile qui s’échappe de l’entrepont fait le trait d’union entre les cuisines espagnoles et les cuisines marocaines et met déjà le cœur à l’envers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
